            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Here we are. Ethiliel has returned to the Aethenwood, Urza Afalas has fled into the night, and it comes to us to deal with whatever lies below. We must find the source of the undead and destroy it."),
