          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("Mad? I am furious!! You accursed mudlings took me and tormented me, tortured me for sport! I knew that once the first strand of black magic left my hands, there would be no turning back. But I would suffer this humiliation no longer..."),
